sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Django
    participant FastAPI
    participant SAHI as SAHI Engine
    participant YOLO as YOLOv11
    participant Storage as Shared Storage
    
    User->>Django: POST /inference<br/>(image)
    Django->>FastAPI: HTTP Request + image
    
    FastAPI->>Storage: Read best_model_ref.json
    Storage-->>FastAPI: {path: "models/best_v5.pt"}
    FastAPI->>Storage: Load model
    Storage-->>FastAPI: Model loaded
    
    FastAPI->>SAHI: Start inference<br/>(image, model, tile_size=640)
    
    Note over SAHI: Tiling Phase
    SAHI->>SAHI: Slice image into 640×640 tiles<br/>(50% overlap)
    SAHI->>SAHI: Generate ~20 tiles
    
    Note over SAHI,YOLO: Per-tile inference
    loop For each tile
        SAHI->>YOLO: Run inference
        YOLO->>YOLO: Detect objects in tile
        YOLO-->>SAHI: Detections [x,y,w,h,conf,class]
    end
    
    Note over SAHI: Merging Phase
    SAHI->>SAHI: Combine detections from all tiles
    SAHI->>SAHI: Apply NMS deduplication<br/>(remove duplicates from overlaps)
    SAHI->>SAHI: Filter by confidence threshold
    SAHI-->>FastAPI: Final detections
    
    FastAPI->>Storage: Save output manifest<br/>(detections + metadata)
    FastAPI-->>Django: SUCCESS<br/>(detections)
    Django-->>User: Detections displayed
